00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.690
But certainly one of the platform,

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:44.390
one of the planks

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:45.258
and in the list

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:47.126
that you laid out from DeSantis

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:48.194
