00:03:50.964 --> 00:03:52.031
and that's abortion.

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:53.233
I think that the six week

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.234
ban, Democrats feel

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:55.134
that is a massive

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:56.369
